      "lineRange": [157, 173],
      "summary": "The result of comparing two staging trees: the paths present in each, the compared file count, and the findings, with an ok property that is true only when nothing diverged.",
      "tags": ["data-model", "dataclass", "result-contract", "comparison"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "class:runner/graph_determinism_check.py:DeterminismResult",
      "type": "class",
      "name": "DeterminismResult",
      "filePath": "runner/graph_determinism_check.py",
      "lineRange": [177, 192],
      "summary": "The overall replay-check outcome, wrapping the Tier 3 and Part B staging comparisons and exposing the aggregate ok verdict and staged file count.",
      "tags": ["data-model", "dataclass", "result-contract", "determinism"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
